              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "The endpoint allows the updating of editable fields in product structure records. Product ID, facility and valid from dates are not editable in this endpoint. If those need updating, create a new structure record."
