            }
          },
          "docs": "Use this endpoint to create multiple product structures for a single product in one call. Each structure is uniquely identified by `customerStructureId` — if none is supplied, the server derives one from the product, facility and `validFrom` date, so only one structure can exist per `(product, facility, date)` combination unless you provide your own unique `customerStructureId`."
        },
